\f1\fs22 Over the next days, Chanta\'92s emotional state improved not at all. He remained cloistered in the flat, refusing to visit the control room even when the Elvi begged. Even his cheeseburgers tasted like plastic. There was no joy in a life without Sarah and Little Clinton.\
